# Google Maps Platform API key for the SvelteKit client & Time Zone endpoint
# Never commit a real API key or hardcode keys in source files.
#
# Option A: Free zero-billing Maps Demo Key (prototyping only, daily quota reset):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
#   4. Generate/reveal the demo key and paste it below
#
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key:
#   1. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Time Zone API
#   3. Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and API scope
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
